{
  "date": "2026-08-31",
  "period_start": "2026-08-01",
  "period_end": "2026-08-31",
  "title": "A much larger media toolbox",
  "summary": "August widened the creative toolkit while making models, agents, community apps, and the infrastructure beneath them much easier to discover and trust.\n\nNew image, video, text, speech, transcription, and embedding options arrived throughout the month, including Krea 2 Medium, Qwen Image 3, Wan 3.0, Gemini Omni 1.1 Flash, FLUX.2, GLM-5.3, Kokoro TTS, Grok TTS, Scribe realtime, and community embeddings. Builders kept the same simple endpoints while gaining more peculiar machines behind them.\n\nThe model catalog was rebuilt into a faster, clearer browser with official and community scopes, persistent search and sorting, capability metadata, model-detail limits, advanced query filters, direct Play links, and compatibility aliases that keep old integrations working while the shelf gets rearranged.\n\nManaged prompt agents gained publishing, Polli CLI management, MCP server attachments, inspectable tool calls, agent discovery and delegation, transcription, and a hosted MCP registry and proxy. Browser builders also got a clearer App Key and PKCE path for bringing their own projects safely into the mix.\n\nThe community directory moved to a validated shared catalog, gained screenshots across hundreds of active apps, shareable search, and steadier publishing workflows. New projects kept arriving across study tools, creative studios, games, accessibility, and self-hosted workflows—the usual result of leaving an open API near people with weekends.",
  "pr_count": 492,
